{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A group of down-on-their-luck bug workers are looking for a way out of their miserable work cycle. But, everything changes when they stumble upon the lost child of the Caterpillar King.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like the rest of us, this little Caterpillar is very hungry, but so are his predators! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead a group of bug workers and protect this AI controlled Caterpillar from his own instincts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve relaxing, tactical puzzles. The bug workers can't deal direct damage, so you must outwit your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical grid-based handcrafted puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bug workers each with their own unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful 2D visuals inspired by children's books.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A soundtrack to relax to.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short and satisfying journey intended for a casual afternoon.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3916610?t=1758978988","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3916610?t=1758978988","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916610/72729503e4f1e32889b53e17d865aafc6d14ba57/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758978988","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916610/72729503e4f1e32889b53e17d865aafc6d14ba57/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758978988","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":